<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Trip Scheduling & Load Planning</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Master the complexity of distribution through intelligent shipment consolidation, accurate 
            geographic planning, and precise resource allocation.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Shipment Lifecycle & Integrity</h2>
        <p>
            Transform sales orders into actionable delivery manifests with a structured workflow. 
            The Trip Scheduling module captures critical shipping metadata—weight, volume, 
            handling requirements, and priority level—ensuring that every order is matched 
            to the appropriate logistics resource. Automated address geocoding ensures that 
            your team is not wasting time navigating to vaguely described locations, 
            improving the precision of ETAs and route calculations.
        </p>
        <p>
            Native integration with the sales module ensures that once a trip is scheduled, 
            the original order status is updated automatically, providing a single 
            version of truth for the entire organization.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Intelligent Consolidating & Capacity</h2>
        <p>
            Maximize vehicle utilization through scientific load planning. The system analyzes 
            the weight and cubic volume of pending deliveries, assisting dispatchers in 
            consolidating multiple orders into single efficient trips based on geographic 
            proximity and vehicle capacity constraints. This architectural focus on 
            minimizing "empty miles" directly translates to lower operational costs 
            and a smaller carbon footprint.
        </p>
        <p>
            Drag-and-drop planning interfaces allow for rapid adjustment of trip manifests 
            in response to changing priorities or vehicle availability, maintaining 
            commercial agility in high-velocity environments.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">SLA-Driven Dispatching</h2>
        <p>
            Ensure your most critical customers are prioritized. Define service level agreements 
            (SLAs) for different client tiers and let the system suggest optimal dispatch 
            sequences that prioritize those with the tightest delivery windows. Live 
            notifications alert dispatchers to orders that are at risk of missing their 
            SLA target, allowing for proactive rescheduling or expediting.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated trip-sheet generation provides drivers with a digital or physical 
            manifest containing all required customer contacts, addresses, and special 
            handling instructions, ensuring a professional handover.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

